# Frontend Rules

## Tech
- React 19 with Vite
- TypeScript (strict, no `any`)
- Tailwind CSS v4 (with @theme inline)
- Framer Motion for animations
- Zustand for state management
- Lucide React for icons

## Design System
- Brand tokens via CSS custom properties (loaded from API)
- Mobile-first responsive design
- 44px minimum touch targets
- NO emoji — use Lucide React icons

## Component Patterns
- Functional components only
- Small, focused — one responsibility
- Shared primitives in `components/ui/`
- Feature components in `components/{feature}/`
- Page-level components in `pages/`

## Animations
- Framer Motion for all transitions
- Sheet/modal: spring with damping 28, stiffness 300
- Duration: 150-300ms for UI, 300-600ms for page transitions
- Easing: [0.22, 1, 0.36, 1] (dramatic ease-out)
- Use `AnimatePresence` for exit animations
- Use `whileTap={{ scale: 0.98 }}` for button feedback

## Styling
- Use brand token CSS variables, not direct Tailwind colors
- `rounded-[var(--radius-md)]` over `rounded-lg`
- `text-text-primary` / `text-text-secondary` / `text-text-muted`
- `bg-surface` / `bg-surface-card` / `bg-surface-elevated`

## API
- All API calls through `src/api/client.ts`
- TypeScript types in `src/types/index.ts`
- Error handling in all async operations
